      "value": "@{5bb80f6b2297f24ce1ccb151|full_name}: Yes I’m also referring to taking a photo of the entire screen. This is why I mentioned the screenshot features for Oculus and WMR. VRC is the only VR screenshot tool I’ve seen that does not have a timer which helps avoid exactly what your request is about.",
